+// Adds the betweenChildren borders of a wrap container: a vertical bar centered in the childGap
+// between neighbours on a line, and a horizontal bar centered in every lineGap, spanning the
+// container. A vertical bar spans its line's band, which reaches halfway into the lineGaps around
